{{ attach_library('asulib_barrio/mirador-help')}}
<details id="mirador-help-block">
    <summary>Tips for Using the Mirador Viewer</summary>
    <ul>
        <li>The panel along the top right of the viewer includes a full screen option <img src="{{ file_url(active_theme_path() ~ '/images/mirador-help/mirador_full_screen_icon.png') }}" alt="Mirador full screen button which is a square with line breaks on to top right bottom and left sides in the middle of each side of the square. This button in the Mirador viewer is labeled as Full screen." width="26" height="22" loading="lazy">to view the object at the full size of your screen.</li>
        <li>To alter the layout options, click the window views &amp; thumbnail display icon <img src="{{ file_url(active_theme_path() ~ '/images/mirador-help/mirador_layout_menu.png') }}" alt="Windows views &amp; thumbnail display button which is a rectangle with a line down the center and a brief space below the icon followed by a horizontal line. This icon in the Mirador viewer is located along the top right corner of the Mirador viewer." width="23" height="19" loading="lazy"></li>
        <li>To search text within the object you are viewing use the search icon <img src="{{ file_url(active_theme_path() ~ '/images/mirador-help/mirador_search_icon.png') }}" alt="Magnifying glass icon for search of content viewable in the Mirador viewer." width="25" height="22" loading="lazy"></li>
        <li>To rotate or to alter the contrast of an image click on the Expand Image Tools icon (to the right of the object) <img src="{{ file_url(active_theme_path() ~ '/images/mirador-help/mirador_image_control_menu.png') }}" alt="Mirador image menu" width="273" height="32" loading="lazy"></li>
    </ul>
</details>